# Machine-specific tooling config (launch.json pins an absolute PHP path).
.claude/

# Zero-byte artifacts from shell redirection in tooling: a '>' inside a
# command's content redirects instead of being passed through, creating a
# file named after whatever followed it. They carry no content and have
# been committed by accident more than once.
*()
